        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Milo Parker, Callan McAuliffe, Ben Kingsley, Gillian Anderson, Anke Engelke, Bastian Pastewka\n- Products: Robot Overlords, Ghost Hunters on Icy Trails, Mr. Holmes, Miss Peregrine's Home for Peculiar Children\n- Roles: Connor, Roger Munro, Hugh Apiston, Hugo\n- Topics: British child actors, film casting\n\nFacts:\n- Milo Parker, born in 2002, is a British child actor.\n- In 2014, the British independent science fiction film Robot Overlords, originally titled Our Robot Overlords, starred Callan McAuliffe, Ben Kingsley, and Gillian Anderson.\n- Milo Parker is known for playing Connor in Robot Overlords, Roger Munro in Mr. Holmes, and Hugh Apiston in Miss Peregrine's Home for Peculiar Children.\n- In 2015, Ghost Hunters on Icy Trails was released as a German-Austrian-Irish comedy film.\n- Ghost Hunters on Icy Trails starred Anke Engelke, Milo Parker, and Bastian Pastewka as the voice of Hugo.",
